{"id":"vod_sn_35927","vodId":"35927","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"腐男子高校生活","name_cn":"腐男子高校生活","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0e262e8d1c2bca24c2e60f32c9c2f23f.jpg"},"summary":"这部每集时长3分钟的动画，讲述了一个腐男子的欢乐日常生活。就读于某学校的平凡男高中生坂口亮（羽多野涉 配音），是一个执迷于BL的腐男子。身为一个男生，坂口对BL无限狂热，热衷于与BL有关的一切事物。对他来说，这种“腐男子”属性有利有弊，一方面，身边的人总是对他的“腐”言论感到困惑，包括他的好朋友中村俊明（野岛健儿 配音）；另一方面，他交上了同样狂热喜爱BL的同好——同班女生西原留美（洲崎绫 配音），不但如此，坂口身边还聚集着白鸟和上田、圭一和零治等有趣家伙。　　本剧改编自日本漫画家みちのくアタミ原作的同名漫画。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:38:54","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6hSH6fzrVk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dg7pfdygMU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9yHiKgkQ341/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rGKD92sihs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/f0ZWgG4pRS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tgxbgpx3Gu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/V0wKkVzJuS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8EcjQ4wZuw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/16SBNHwGaS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9BSbxeWKHN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JA0hwF7Kb41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tVG5nKSjfE1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:29.064Z"}